# ============================================================================
# CHAOS REDUX - CHAOS UI WEAR OVERLAYS
# ============================================================================
# Click-through surface-damage decals (hairline fractures and chips) drawn on
# vanilla interface borders. Every decal exists once per Chaos tier (1-5) and
# colour: tier icons show fixed frames; world end has one stronger red icon.
# common/scripted_guis/chaos_ui_wear_scripted_gui.txt shows exactly one of them
# by reading the live chaos_tier and world_end global flags. Calm World (tier 0)
# shows nothing unless world end is active. Decals sit on masked borders, not
# controls or text. The historical gen_gui.py describes the original variant. See
# docs/systems/chaos_ui_wear.md.
# ============================================================================

